<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= locals.title ? title : '404 - Không tìm thấy trang' %> | SeoulFire</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
            background-color: #f8f5f2;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .status-card {
            background: #fff;
            padding: 50px 40px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            max-width: 500px;
            width: 90%;
        }
        .error-code {
            font-size: 100px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #d32f2f;
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-size: 24px;
        }
        p {
            color: #666;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .btn-home {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #d32f2f;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: background 0.3s ease;
        }
        .btn-home:hover {
            background-color: #b71c1c;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="status-card">
        <div class="error-code">404</div>
        <h1>Không tìm thấy trang</h1>
        <p>Xin lỗi, trang bạn đang tìm kiếm không tồn tại hoặc đã bị gỡ bỏ. Vui lòng kiểm tra lại đường dẫn.</p>
        <a href="/" class="btn-home"><i class="fa-solid fa-house"></i> Về Trang Chủ</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
